scended from the Donghu, an eastern branch of the Xianbei tribe. In the early Cao Wei era, their ancestor Mohuba led his tribe to relocate to Liaoxi. He took part alongside Guanqiu Jian and Sima Yi in the expedition against Gongsun Yuan in Liaodong, and was enfeoffed by Cao Wei as the King of Guided Righteousness for his merits, initially establishing his domain North of Jicheng. In the Western Jin, Murong Hui expanded their influence further, and his descendants founded regimes including Former Yan, Later Yan, Western Yan, and Southern Yan during the Sixteen Kingdoms period."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"5","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"慕容吐谷浑","height":"平均","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[77,76,78,66,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[77,76,78,66,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1028705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[77,76,78,66,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"80","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP10287